The room would be disappointed if it didn't get sex.
如果沒有，這間房一定很失望

196
00:11:31,04 --> 00:11:34,80
All the other honeymoon suites would think it was a loser.
在其他蜜月套房面前抬不起頭

197
00:11:36,21 --> 00:11:37,47
好吧 那好

198
00:11:40,75 --> 00:11:42,98
Nope! Not under here!
沒有，沒看到

200
00:11:45,95 --> 00:11:48,28
-You didn't find her? -I've looked everywhere.
你還沒找到她？我到處都找不到

202
00:11:48,55 --> 00:11:51,15
You couldn't have, or you would've found her.
你一定漏掉什麼地方 否則早就找到了

203
00:11:51,39 --> 00:11:54,09
-Keep looking! -Yeah! For about 30 minutes?
你應該繼續找 大概再找個30分鐘

205
00:11:54,29 --> 00:11:55,72
Or 45?
或是45分鐘

206
00:11:58,46 --> 00:12:01,06
In 45 minutes, you could find her twice.
45分鐘可以找到兩次了

207
00:12:04,57 --> 00:12:09,63
For all I know,she's trying to find me but couldn't,because I kept moving.
不了，她一定也找不到我 因為我跑來跑去

208
00:12:09,94 --> 00:12:12,57
From now on, I'm staying in one place.
從現在開始我不動了 

209
00:12:12,81 --> 00:12:14,24
