217
00:12:43,94 --> 00:12:48,00
I really appreciate this, but you don't need to rub my butt.
我很感激你們的好意 但是你也不用摸我屁股

218
00:13:02,86 --> 00:13:04,89
We have to leave in an hour.
我們一小時後就要回紐約了

219
00:13:05,16 --> 00:13:07,79
I know. I've been looking at those doors.
我知道 我一直在看那扇門 

220
00:13:08,03 --> 00:13:10,97
They look pretty soundproof, don't you think?
隔音效果似乎很好

221
00:13:11,37 --> 00:13:13,67
We can't do that. That's insane.
不行，你瘋了

222
00:13:13,97 --> 00:13:17,41
I mean,A,he could wake up. And B,you know...
第一，他可能醒來 第二，

223
00:13:17,68 --> 00:13:19,04
...Iet's go for it.
管他的 

224
00:13:24,22 --> 00:13:26,45
艾蜜莉？艾蜜莉…

225
00:13:29,32 --> 00:13:30,75
Nope.
不是她

227
00:13:32,09 --> 00:13:34,75
-She's not with us. -We've come for her things.
不用找她了，她沒跟來 我們來拿她的東西

228
00:13:34,99 --> 00:13:37,05
Where is she?
她在哪裡？

229
00:13:37,33 --> 00:13:41,59
She's in hiding. She's humiliated. She doesn't want to see you again.
她躲起來了，因為她很丟臉 這輩子都不想再見到你

230
00:13:41,93 --> 00:13:46,93
We're very sad that it didn't work out between you and Emily,monkey.
很遺憾你們兩個鬧成這樣 兔崽子

231
00:13:48,57 --> 00:13:52,24
But I think you're absolutely delicious!
不過你實在是秀色可餐

232
00:13:52,91 --> 00:13:56,94
Excuse me, I'm standing right here.
抱歉，我人還站在這裡

233
00:13:58,35 --> 00:13:59,54
Oh,yes.
是啊，

234
00:13:59,78 --> 00:14:01,91
There you are.
陰魂不散

235
00:14:04,19 --> 00:14:07,75
Hurry up! Get some! There's a whole cart outside.
大家動作快，外面還有一車

236
00:14:07,99 --> 00:14:09,02
Goodbye,Geller.
再見了，蓋勒

237
00:14:09,29 --> 00:14:11,19
Now,hold on. Hold on.
等一下…

238
00:14:11,43 --> 00:14:16,37
Your daughter and I are supposed to leave tonight for our honeymoon.
令嬡跟我今晚預定去度蜜月

239
00:14:16,67 --> 00:14:20,83
Tell her I'll be at that airport, and I hope she will too.
請你們轉告她，我會去機場 我希望她也會去

240
00:14:21,37 --> 00:14:24,40
I said Rachel's name, but it didn't mean anything.
我是說成瑞秋的名字 但這只是無心之過

241
00:14:24,68 --> 00:14:25,87
She's just a friend.
她不過是我的朋友

242
00:14:26,14 --> 00:14:27,91
Tell Emily I love her and...
就這樣，請轉告艾蜜莉 我愛她

243
00:14:28,18 --> 00:14:31,44
...I can't imagine spending my life with anyone else.
我只想跟她共度餘生

244
00:14:31,68 --> 00:14:35,12
Please,promise me that you'll tell her that.
請保證你們一定會轉告她

245
00:14:36,65 --> 00:14:38,14
All right,I'll tell her.
我會告訴她，

246
00:14:38,82 --> 00:14:40,69
Come on,bugger face!
走吧，臭婆娘

247
00:14:41,33 --> 00:14:42,52
Call me.
打電話給我

248
00:14:43,66 --> 00:14:48,76
You spend your life in the bathroom. Why do you never go out the window?
你也一天到晚待在廁所 怎麼就不會從窗戶滾蛋

249
00:15:06,05 --> 00:15:09,18
Maybe it's best we never got to do it again.
或許我們不再上床才對

250
00:15:09,39 --> 00:15:12,51
Yeah,it kind of makes that one night special.
否則那晚就不特別了

251
00:15:16,36 --> 00:15:19,96
Technically,we still are over international waters.
理論上而言，我們還在海外

252
00:15:21,30 --> 00:15:25,03
I'm going to the bathroom. Maybe I'll see you there?
我去洗手間，待會來找我？

253
00:15:24,00 --> 00:15:25,03
好

254
00:15:32,54 --> 00:15:34,01
Can I ask you something?
我可以問個問題嗎？

255
00:15:35,25 --> 00:15:36,41
不行

256
00:15:37,65 --> 00:15:41,71
Felicity and I watched My Giant. And I thought:
我昨晚跟費麗西蒂 一起看「我的巨人」

257
00:15:41,92 --> 00:15:45,18
"I'll never be as good an actor as that giant."
我心想：自己永遠不可能 演得跟那個巨人一樣棒

258
00:15:45,42 --> 00:15:49,05
Do you think I'm wasting my life with this acting thing?
我想當演員是否只是癡心妄想

259
00:15:50,83 --> 00:15:52,82
The giant's five years younger than me.
那個巨人大概比我小五歲

261
00:15:53,06 --> 00:15:54,93
You think I'll ever get there?
我有辦法跟他一樣優秀嗎？

262
00:15:57,10 --> 00:15:58,50
會的

263
00:16:00,10 --> 00:16:02,50
-Thanks,man. -Okay,man.
