264
00:16:02,77 --> 00:16:05,71
But what about how much taller he is than me?
但是他比我高好多啊

266
00:16:06,61 --> 00:16:10,60
I mean,there's no way I can make myself taller now.
我現在已經不可能再長高

267
00:16:10,85 --> 00:16:14,58
Who knows what science will come up with in the future...
以後科學怎麼發展我不知道

268
00:16:14,85 --> 00:16:18,55
...but what if I die an unsuccessful, regular-size man?
如果我死時只是一個 身高平庸的小人物呢？

269
00:16:20,59 --> 00:16:23,58
You've been in the bathroom for a half-hour.
摩妮卡，你廁所上了半個小時

270
00:16:24,46 --> 00:16:25,45
I know!
我知道

271
00:16:26,60 --> 00:16:28,26
Had the beef tips,huh?
你也吃了牛肉？

272
00:16:40,38 --> 00:16:43,64
嗨 嗨

273
00:16:43,75 --> 00:16:45,24
嗨

274
00:16:46,15 --> 00:16:47,71
You ate meat!
你吃過肉了

275
00:16:49,95 --> 00:16:51,05
You had sex!
你跟人嘿咻

276
00:16:53,46 --> 00:16:54,45
No,we didn't.
我們才沒有

277
00:16:54,63 --> 00:16:57,82
I know you didn't. I was talking about Monica.
我知道你沒有 我說的是摩妮卡

278
00:16:59,26 --> 00:17:00,73
I did not have sex.
菲比，我才沒跟人嘿咻

279
00:17:00,93 --> 00:17:05,99
This pregnancy is throwing me all off and making me fat.
懷孕害我靈感不准 而且還變得胖嘟嘟

281
00:17:06,17 --> 00:17:08,90
-I'll say hi to the chick and duck. -Me too!
我要去跟小雞小鴨打招呼 我跟你去

282
00:17:09,14 --> 00:17:11,80
Why would you need to? You've been feeding them.
你何必去？ 你不是四天都去餵它們？

284
00:17:12,31 --> 00:17:15,04
Oh,right. Maybe I'll just go home.
沒錯，我回家好了

285
00:17:25,82 --> 00:17:27,22
We certainly are alone.
只剩下我們兩個

286
00:17:27,46 --> 00:17:30,29
Good thing we have that "not New York" rule.
幸好我們說好回紐約就不行

287
00:17:30,03 --> 00:17:31,19
沒錯

288
00:17:32,50 --> 00:17:35,56
Listen,since we're on that subject...
既然你說到這個

289
00:17:35,80 --> 00:17:38,46
...I just wanted to tell you that....
我想告訴你…

290
00:17:38,74 --> 00:17:41,73
I was going through a hard time in London...
當時我在倫敦心情很不好

291
00:17:41,97 --> 00:17:47,14
...with my brother getting married and that guy thinking I was Ross' mother.
因為哥哥結婚 別人還把我認作他媽

292
00:17:45,78 --> 00:17:47,27
我知道

293
00:17:48,41 --> 00:17:50,47
Well,anyway,I just....
那晚對我來說意義非凡

294
00:17:50,68 --> 00:17:54,17
That night meant a lot to me. And I'm trying to say thanks.
我的意思是…我要謝謝你

296
00:17:58,49 --> 00:18:00,98
You know,that night meant a lot to me too.
我那天也不是隨便上床

297
00:18:01,26 --> 00:18:04,42
It wasn't because I was in a bad place or anything.
並不是因為我受到逼迫

298
00:18:04,66 --> 00:18:07,82
It just meant a lot because you're really hot.
我很重視那晚是因為 你很性感

299
00:18:12,27 --> 00:18:13,29
Is that okay?
這樣說可以嗎？

300
00:18:13,50 --> 00:18:14,84
That's okay.
沒關係

301
00:18:15,87 --> 00:18:16,86
And I'm cute too?
而且我也很帥

302
00:18:19,48 --> 00:18:20,64
And you're cute too!
而且你也很帥 

303
00:18:20,84 --> 00:18:21,94
Thank you.
謝謝

304
00:18:22,68 --> 00:18:24,84
All right,I gotta go unpack.
我要去整理行李了 好

305
00:18:28,99 --> 00:18:30,28
再見

306
00:18:43,07 --> 00:18:45,47
I'm still on London time. Does that count?
我時差還沒調回來 這表示我還在倫敦吧

307
00:18:47,04 --> 00:18:49,03
-Oh,that counts! -Oh,good!
沒錯 太好了

308
00:18:57,65 --> 00:18:59,62
瑞秋…

309
00:19:01,15 --> 00:19:02,58
What are you doing here?
你怎麼會在這裡？

311
00:19:02,85 --> 00:19:06,19
I've been on standby for a flight home for hours.
我在等候補機位回紐約

312
00:19:07,86 --> 00:19:09,22
So no sign of Emily?
你還沒等到艾蜜莉？

313
00:19:09,76 --> 00:19:10,92
