When do you have to leave?
你是幾點的飛機？

315
00:19:18,27 --> 00:19:22,14
This is the last call for flight 1066 to A thens.
最後一次呼叫 前往雅典的1066班機

316
00:19:22,34 --> 00:19:23,86
The last call.
最後一次呼叫

317
00:19:24,07 --> 00:19:25,84
Pretty soon,I guess.
就快了 是啊

318
00:19:28,51 --> 00:19:29,91
I'm sorry.
我很遺憾

319
00:19:31,45 --> 00:19:32,51
I don't understand.
我不明白

320
00:19:32,72 --> 00:19:34,62
How could she do this?
她怎麼可以這麼做？

321
00:19:34,85 --> 00:19:39,22
Am I a complete idiot for thinking she'd actually show up?
我是不是白癡？ 竟然以為她會來

322
00:19:40,86 --> 00:19:45,02
You're not an idiot,Ross. You're a guy very much in love.
你不是白癡，羅斯 你只是愛得無可救藥

324
00:19:46,06 --> 00:19:47,39
Same difference.
那還不是一樣

325
00:19:47,60 --> 00:19:52,70
All passengers for flight 1066 to Athens should now be onboard.
搭乘1066班機 前往雅典的旅客請登機

326
00:19:52,94 --> 00:19:54,37
I get it!
聽到了

327
00:19:58,88 --> 00:20:00,37
Well,that's that.
沒搞頭了

328
00:20:01,45 --> 00:20:02,94
No,you know what?
錯，

329
00:20:03,15 --> 00:20:04,44
I think you should go.
你應該去

330
