I think you should go...
什麼？ 對

331
00:20:08,09 --> 00:20:10,42
...by yourself. Get some distance.
你應該自己去 到遙遠的地方想個清楚

332
00:20:10,65 --> 00:20:13,32
Clear your head. It would be really good.
這對你一定有好處

333
00:20:13,56 --> 00:20:15,25
I don't know.
我不知道…

335
00:20:15,46 --> 00:20:18,16
Come on. It would be really good for you.
羅斯，你應該要去

336
00:20:20,63 --> 00:20:22,72
I could do that.
沒錯，我應該去 對

337
00:20:24,30 --> 00:20:26,90
I can't even believe her.
她實在太扯了

338
00:20:27,10 --> 00:20:29,00
You know what? I am going to go.
知道嗎？我決定去了

339
00:20:29,27 --> 00:20:30,40
-Good. -Why not?
很好 有何不可呢？

340
00:20:30,61 --> 00:20:31,63
-Right? -Right.
對 對不對？沒錯

341
00:20:32,14 --> 00:20:33,13
Thanks.
謝了

342
00:20:33,34 --> 00:20:34,81
I'll see you back at home.
我們紐約見了 

343
00:20:35,08 --> 00:20:37,17
If I ever get a flight out of here.
希望我搭得上飛機

345
00:20:40,08 --> 00:20:42,42
What? Wait,what?
其實…算了 怎麼了？

346
00:20:44,12 --> 00:20:45,45
Why don't you come?
不如你也一起來 

347
00:20:45,66 --> 00:20:48,75
I mean,I have two tickets. Why not?
反正我有兩張機票

348
00:20:49,99 --> 00:20:53,66
Well,I don't know,Ross. Really?
不太好吧？真的嗎？

349
00:20:54,67 --> 00:20:57,29
Yeah. It'd be great. I mean,you can....
是啊，一定很好玩 

350
00:20:57,53 --> 00:20:59,37
You can lay on the beach...
你可以躺在海灘上

351
00:20:59,60 --> 00:21:02,94
...and I can cry over my failed marriage.
我可以哭訴婚姻失敗 

352
