You see how I make jokes?
你看我多幽默啊

353
00:21:06,14 --> 00:21:07,44
Really. I mean....
真的，

354
00:21:08,31 --> 00:21:09,84
I could use a friend.
我需要有朋友陪我

355
00:21:10,15 --> 00:21:13,61
Oh,wow. Maybe.
好吧，無妨

356
00:21:16,19 --> 00:21:17,38
Yes,I can do that!
我可以陪你去

357
00:21:18,19 --> 00:21:20,32
-Cool. -All right,cool.
好 好 太好了 是啊

359
00:21:20,76 --> 00:21:22,69
走吧，拿去

360
00:21:22,29 --> 00:21:24,45
Okay,we're going to Greece.
我們這就走

361
00:21:24,70 --> 00:21:26,56
I forgot my jacket!
我忘了拿外套 等一下

362
00:21:26,80 --> 00:21:29,03
Well,you tell them to wait.
你叫他們等一下

363
00:21:29,33 --> 00:21:30,73
Wait! Wait!
等一下

364
00:21:36,17 --> 00:21:38,14
艾蜜莉

365
00:21:43,15 --> 00:21:49,48
不是啦…別走，艾蜜莉

366
00:21:51,99 --> 00:21:54,51
I'll have a glass of Merlot...
我要梅洛紅酒

367
00:21:54,79 --> 00:21:57,49
...and he'll have a wine spritzer.
這位要氣泡白酒

368
00:22:04,80 --> 00:22:07,20
Look! The airport's moving.
你們看，機場在動

369
00:22:07,90 --> 00:22:09,06
Are we moving?
飛機在動嗎？

370
00:22:09,34 --> 00:22:11,40
Are we? Why are we moving?
飛機在動嗎？為什麼？

371
00:22:12,88 --> 00:22:16,00
Does the captain know that we're moving?
機長知道飛機在動嗎？

372
00:22:17,65 --> 00:22:18,64
Oh,my gosh!
天啊，老天爺

373
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


374
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


375
00:22:19,18 --> 00:22:21,17
Mandarin-R3

